        "### 🎯 Aims:\n",
        "- Return a list containing one dictionary per mismatch, in ascending position order.\n",
        "- Each dictionary has exactly these keys:\n",
        "    - `position`: position of the mutation (integer), numbered from 1.\n",
        "    - `reference_base`: one-character string from reference at that position.\n",
        "    - `read_base`: one-character string from the read at that position.\n",
        "\n",
        "- Return `[]` if the read matches the reference.\n",
